sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Worker A
  participant S as WorkItemStore
  participant B as Worker B
  A->>S: claim -> token L1
  A--xA: pause / network partition
  S->>S: expiresAt reached, reclaim
  B->>S: claim -> token L2
  A->>S: complete(token L1)
  S-->>A: stale lease rejected
  B->>S: complete(token L2)
  S-->>B: completed
